      Data: 151|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Shadow blur radius applied after baking, normalized to 128x128 shadow
        resolution. Editor baking uses spherical shadow-space blur to reduce visible
        cubemap and Spot Light projection seams. Runtime baking uses Planar Blur
        unless Spherical Blur is enabled on the runtime baker. 0 keeps the baked
        shadow map unblurred. Requires rebaking.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
